 "description": "The Alpha Rejected Me, Now He Wants Our Twins My Secret Twins Are the Alpha's Heirs On the night of the Blood Moon, Luna Elara's world was shattered by betrayal. While giving birth to the Alpha's children, Elara was told that one of her newborn twins had died. Behind the tragedy lurked a ruthless conspiracy. The ambitious Selene sought to seize her position, while powerful pack elders feared the prophecy surrounding the mysterious bloodline of Elara's children. When Alpha Lucian became entangled in a deadly power struggle, Elara lost everything—her mate, her position, and the future she had dreamed of. Heartbroken and abandoned, she disappeared from the werewolf kingdom, raising her surviving child in secrecy. Seven years later, a mysterious blonde woman wearing an elegant mask returns to the territory. No one recognizes her as the Luna they once humiliated and cast aside. But Elara is hiding a secret powerful enough to bring the entire kingdom to its knees. The child believed to have died seven years ago may still be alive. Even more shocking, the separated twins possess an extraordinary bloodline inherited from the legendary Alpha dynasty. Their awakening powers could make them the strongest heirs the werewolf world has ever known. As the truth begins to surface, ancient enemies emerge, powerful nobles tremble, and long-buried conspiracies threaten to destroy the royal pack. Alpha Lucian finally discovers that the woman he lost is alive—and that his children may hold the key to the kingdom's future. Overwhelmed by regret, he desperately tries to reclaim his family. But Elara is no longer the helpless Luna who once begged for protection. After seven years of suffering, she has learned to survive without him. She refuses to surrender her children to the same people who once tried to destroy them. With her twins' extraordinary abilities awakening, Elara prepares to expose every betrayal, reclaim her stolen honor, and make her enemies pay. When the lost twins finally reunite, their combined power sends shockwaves through the entire werewolf kingdom. The elders who once condemned them are forced to confront the heirs they tried to erase. And the mighty Alpha who once failed his family must face an impossible choice: fight for Elara's forgiveness or lose the people he loves forever. They called her children a curse. Now the entire wolf kingdom will kneel before its rightful heirs.",
