 "description": "# *Tales of the Immortal Melody Across the Sea* Han Xiangzi, one of the Eight Immortals, wields the Purple‑Gold Xiao flute. He meets Lin Wan, a being incarnated from a spirit pearl. The Heavenly Court colludes with the Dragon King of the East China Sea, plotting to refine Lin Wan to mend the Three‑Realms barrier. The pair survive seven severe trials on Penglai Immortal Mountain and join forces with the Eight Immortals to expose the conspiracy. They fight against the Heavenly Emperor, the ancient beast Qiongqi, and forces of Chaos. Through brutal wars, death and soul‑rebirth tribulations, they see through the emptiness of power and reject multiple supreme divine titles. They settle in Suzhou in the mortal world and open the Immortal Melody Teahouse. With the music of his xiao flute, Han Xiangzi soothes souls and aids the needy, guarding common folk. They desire no celestial glory, only to stay true to each other amid the tranquil mortal world. ## Main Characters **Han Xiangzi**: One of the Eight Immortals, a master of music, bearer of the Purple‑Gold Xiao. Passionate‑hearted and spiritually perceptive. He dares to defy unjust heavenly decrees. Capable of slaying demons with his flute, yet indifferent to divine rank and power. Having endured countless life‑and‑death ordeals, he holds fast to his creed: to protect his beloved as well as all living beings. In the end, he chooses to wander freely among mortals. **Lin Wan**: Incarnation of the core of the Pearl of Fixing the Sea, a spirit‑pearl entity. She once shattered a magical barrier to save millions of lives. Resolute and valiant, she commands formidable dragon power. She shares life‑or‑death bonds with Han Xiangzi and sacrifices herself for him many times. Unfazed by the exalted title of Sea‑Spirit Ruler, she chooses mortal companionship, safeguarding mountains, rivers and all people. **Lü Dongbin**: Core figure among the Eight Immortals, thoughtful and resourceful. He lurks within the Heavenly Court gathering evidence. At critical moments he lays bare the Heavenly Emperor’s schemes and repeatedly comes to Han Xiangzi and Lin Wan’s aid.",
