 "description": "Clara, a virgin math teacher married five years, pays a fortune to learn seduction at The Crimson Room to save her loveless marriage—only to be claimed by mafia boss Dante as his \"Venus.\" When fire erupts, he saves her, imprisons her in his estate, and forces her to sign a contract. She signs to protect her husband Ethan, then learns the truth: Ethan betrayed Dante, owes three million in gambling debts, and is cheating with her best friend Scarlett, plotting to steal her inheritance—while the man who once saved her from the rubble was Dante himself. Heartbroken, Clara turns ruthless: she fakes a transfer, foils the notary, outplays the drugged wine, and forces Ethan to sign a divorce with nothing. When the contract ends, Dante confesses his love. Her answer: \"You.\"",
 "about": "The Mafia Boss Claimed Me is an English short drama in 47 episodes, originally released on ReelShort in October 2026. It falls under Mafia & Gangster, Cheating & Betrayal, Heir & Heiress and Revenge. Every episode is free to watch on DramaDog, with no app or sign-up.",
