 "description": "On graduation night, the whole rooftop was cheering for my boyfriend. He'd just signed a ten-million-dollar deal with the Bowens' pro team, the team owned by the oldest vampire family in the state. The second I raised my champagne, a cake knife sank into my neck from behind. It was my best friend holding it. She'd dropped out, gotten hooked on pills, spent two years sleeping in her car. She said, \"You don't get to be happy while I rot.\" I opened my eyes at the freshman welcome dance. And she was back too. She grabbed my quarterback and tossed me the broke water boy. \"Nobody wants him. He's all yours.\" I stepped in front of him. Who says nobody likes him? I like him.",
