 "cover": "https://dramadog.app/c/31401.webp",
 "description": "Diana had deeply loved her stepbrother Lucas since childhood, but Lucas only ever treated her as a substitute for his unattainable first love, Ella.Eight years ago, Ella accidentally fell from a building while secretly meeting the base instructor, Raven. Raven framed Diana using a necklace she had dropped. After waking up from a five-year coma, Ella accused Diana of the attack. Lucas refused to investigate and sent Diana away to an island base. Over the next three years, Ella bribed Raven to forge reports, subjecting Diana to violence and humiliation. After returning to New York for a wedding, Diana was framed once again, but her childhood acquaintance, Evan, stepped forward to protect her and uncovered the truth.She rejected the Scott family's belated repentance, married Evan, and received treatment. Reclaiming her name, her dignity, and her life, she truly embraced a new beginning.",
